This distribution contains unmodified factory_nut and factory_bolt USDZ assets
and their metadata, plus derived NumPy mesh arrays for a MuJoCo adapter.
Conversion modifications: USD transforms and meter units applied, origin moved
to bottom-center, polygon faces triangulated, invalid shading normals repaired.
Original geometry is not redesigned or decimated. Diffuse colors are applied
by the adapter; the original PhysX SDF collision behavior is not implemented.

RoboDojo benchmark contributors retain rights in the original assets. See the
source repository for authorship and citation. No upstream NOTICE file was
provided with these selected asset directories.
